<title>PORTUGAL: BCP boosts nine-month profit 10.2 pct.</title>
<headline>BCP boosts nine-month profit 10.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Sept 30:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p> Cons net		15.67 vs 14.22</p>
<p>Financial margin  3.2 pct vs 3.0 pct</p>
<p> Deposits		4,088 vs 4,537</p>
<p> Loans		   2,113 vs 1,997</p>
<p> Total assets	  5,360 vs 5,545</p>
<p>NOTE: Banco Comercial Portugues SA (BCP) said that the consolidation of Banco Portugues do Atlantico (BPA) from the second quarter of 1995 and subsequent financial restructuring of the group meant that the results of the first nine months of 1996 were not directly comparable with the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
